    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98622343e39286d0629ab998",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早早早早上好！！\r\n呼啊～……！今天也勉强赶上了……\r\n呼哈，呼哈……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24fe9a92ec3d16bf12b5a8ef6240c0e0ba6e921beac127d9b35ad833efedbcff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
